{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/f/9efaf4303fae60aee8a2ea3efc0082033b63811b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}=\\overline{AC}=3.6$\" width=\"127\" height=\"15\" />, a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is taken on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> at a distance <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499e5d3fb13c7f899257773b0a1b7ebfc699d001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is joined to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> in the prolongation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/1/18167d788fd698322ba516cf8bfdba2c931fa17d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AED$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> is equal in area to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e8bc36793a7c64d05fff20d519f0f72d9256fab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AE}$\" width=\"28\" height=\"15\" /> is: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/c/1bc5b55ecced28abfab9d17a8e552ddd22b3e5d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4.8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5.4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 7.2\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 10.8\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 12.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"437\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636d1f23a4a183d1e0511c4dcdf069f8cb9d7cc3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy]  import geometry;  point B = (0,0); point C = (10,0); point A = (5,12); point D = 2*A/3; point E = 3(C-A)+A;  // Triangle ABC draw(A--B--C--A); dot(A); label(&quot;A&quot;,A,N); dot(B); label(&quot;B&quot;,B,SW); dot(C); label(&quot;C&quot;,C,SE);  // Triangle ADE draw(A--D--E--A); dot(D); label(&quot;D&quot;,D,NW); dot(E); label(&quot;E&quot;,E,SE);  [/asy]\" width=\"158\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/1/871c9f7bd8d03ab287154e9f76cbb59f3638ea9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[\\triangle ABC]=[\\triangle ADE]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/0/760ef5659ca3de6bc4f748fb4af312c9d30f9190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}AB * AC *\\sin\\angle BAC = \\frac{1}{2}AD * AE *\\sin\\angle DAE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"394\" height=\"37\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/585f266156665a53922befe7c6d7bffb05d0af14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC = \\angle DAE$\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/9/5a9de205644aad05de90ede69394b5ce59f3fc0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB*AC = AD*AE$\" width=\"171\" height=\"13\" />, so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/1/36142881392be3a0dc432c07a42d5fcec436a646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3.6*3.6 = 1.2*AE$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"156\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abbcfc272cf052c0c3289080b03d606002f040e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE = \\frac{3.6^2}{1.2}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }10.8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"193\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1959\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 1